# Things to Avoid

- Do NOT build real airline/GDS integrations, real payment gateways, or hotel/bus/train bookings.
- Do NOT allow raw SQL or direct DB mutations by LLM without tools.
- Do NOT auto-finalize bookings without user confirmation.
- Do NOT exceed 500 lines of code per file.
- Do NOT return ungrounded travel policy answers without RAG context.
